<title>USA: Brightpoint votes 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Brightpoint votes 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brightpoint Inc said Tuesday that it declared a three-for-two stock split to be effected in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on December 16 to holders of record as of November 25.</p>
<p>The ex-dividend date for the common stock will be December 17.</p>
<p>Brightpoint distributes wireless communications eqiupment and related products.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
